{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Keep in mind this is only a DEMO and includes only Day 1.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Ramen Shop</strong> is an psychological horror game where you manage a ramen shop. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take orders from your customers, serve them your delicious  ramen, and some drinks if they're thirsty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119170/extras/861d670e670924ea81a0d5266002472f.poster.avif?t=1761825348\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119170/extras/861d670e670924ea81a0d5266002472f.webm?t=1761825348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Mika, recently hired to manage a ramen shop after the owner mysteriously fell ill. With every passing shift, the air grows colder and the incidents stranger. Can you uncover the truth before your fate is sealed?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119170/extras/6386fa5934d99130bd2e19d0c18810a2.poster.avif?t=1761825348\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119170/extras/6386fa5934d99130bd2e19d0c18810a2.webm?t=1761825348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take orders</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serve customers your delicious ramens</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do chores</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the strange events</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4119170?t=1761825348","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4119170?t=1761825348","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119170/86969e901ec925b5841630211a5eba3ae23dc218/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761825348","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119170/86969e901ec925b5841630211a5eba3ae23dc218/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761825348","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Keep in mind this is only a DEMO and includes only Day 1.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Ramen Shop</strong> is an psychological horror game where you manage a ramen shop. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take orders from your customers, serve them your delicious  ramen, and some drinks if they're thirsty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119170/extras/861d670e670924ea81a0d5266002472f.poster.avif?t=1761825348\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119170/extras/861d670e670924ea81a0d5266002472f.webm?t=1761825348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragra